slut
wanker
twat
bollocks
arse
arsehole
asshole
piss
bugger
shag
knob

# --- Slurs -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kept in even though the lists above were cut hard. A slur in a school tool is
# not a vocabulary question and the cost of missing one is not symmetric with
# the cost of masking one.
nigger
nigga
faggot
fag
retard
retarded
spastic
tranny
chink
gook
wog
paki
